# In the code of a callable the record `data(D)` launches the data of the live launch over D (the book, #ordinary-var;
# the author's decision 2026-11-11 through fable2, plan M11 5b part 2): the data part of f, `int: n 5`, run as code over
# D writes 5 into D's n.
fn: f () int (int: n 5)
    data(D)
    return: 1
D(int: n 1)
int: r f()
int: seen D\n
